## Automated Testing Documentation

### Overview

The **Lifestage Browser-Based Tests** repo is a Playwright E2E test automation framework that tests the DMT (Dependents Management Tools) forms on VA.gov staging. It automates browser-based testing of the Veteran-facing forms built by the DMT squad.

**Repo:** https://github.com/department-of-veterans-affairs/lifestage-browser-based-tests

### Test Coverage Summary

**54 automated tests** across 41 test files covering 2 form types:

| Form | Tests | What It Covers |
|------|-------|----------------|
| **0538** (Verify Dependents) | 10 | Submission, in-progress save, error handling, input validation, 0538↔686c integration |
| **686c/674 V2** (Add/Remove Dependents) | 26 | Add spouse/child/student, remove dependents (death, divorce, marriage, school), error handling, input validation, duplicate detection |
| **686c/674 V3** (Picklist Removal Flows) | 18 | All removal flows with V3 picklist UI, early exit scenarios (adoption, disability), outside-US flows |

