### CI/CD Workflows

All workflows are **manual trigger only** (`workflow_dispatch`) via GitHub Actions:

| Workflow | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| **Nightly Run** | Runs all 54 form tests against staging |
| **Hourly Monitor** | 2 smoke tests every hour (except 5-8 AM UTC) |
| **User Keep-Alive** | Logs in test users to prevent account lockout |
| **V2 686c/674** | V2 form tests only |
| **V3 Picklist** | V3 removal flow tests only |
| **FDF 686c/674** | FDF-specific tests |
| **0538** | 0538 form tests only |
| **Lint** | ESLint on PRs and pushes to main |

### Architecture & Key Features

- **Page Object Model** — reusable page classes for each form section (e.g., `SpouseInformationPage.ts`, `ChildInformationPage.ts`)
- **Stealth Plugin** — bypasses bot detection on VA.gov staging using `playwright-extra`
- **Payload Interception** — captures and validates API payloads submitted by forms against baseline JSON files
- **Environment Config** — `config/dmt/staging.env` with `BASE_URL` and credentials
- **Docker Support** — containerized test execution via `Dockerfile`
- **Login via ID.me** on staging
- **Feature toggle interception** for testing behind feature flags
- **Screenshot capture** on test failure
- **Automatic retry** on flaky tests

### Project Structure

```
src/
├── fixtures/common/         # Custom Playwright fixtures (stealth browser)
├── pages/                   # Page Object Models
│   ├── 0538/               # 0538 form pages
│   ├── 686c674/            # 686c/674 form pages
│   ├── common/             # Shared pages (login, navigation, VA components)
│   └── security/           # Security/auth pages
├── tests/
│   ├── forms/0538/         # 0538 form tests (5 files, 10 tests)
│   ├── forms/686c674/v2/   # 686c/674 V2 tests (17 files, 26 tests)
│   ├── forms/686c674/v3/   # 686c/674 V3 tests (15 files, 18 tests)
│   ├── forms/686c674/fdf/  # FDF-specific tests
│   ├── forms/686c674/pension/ # Pension-related tests
│   ├── maintenance/        # User keep-alive tests
│   ├── manage_dependents/  # Dependents view tests
│   └── myVa/              # My VA page tests
├── utils/                   # Helpers (API, login, test data, payload validation)
└── setup/                   # Global test setup
config/dmt/                  # Environment configs (staging.env)
resources/                   # Test data, payloads, and documents
docs/                        # Test coverage reports
```

### How to Run

```bash
# Install
npm install && npx playwright install

# Run all tests
npm test

# Run form tests against staging
npm run test_forms

# Run hourly smoke tests
npm run test_monitor_job

# Run specific test locally
npx cross-env Environment=staging.local Module=dmt playwright test <test-file> --project=chromium
```

